# Patterns are matched against paths relative to the build context (the repo
# root). Docker does NOT match a bare pattern recursively, so nested paths need
# an explicit `**/` prefix.

# VCS & local tooling
.git
.gitignore
.github
.husky
.vscode

# Dependencies and build output (root + every workspace package)
node_modules
**/node_modules
**/dist
**/.next
**/coverage

# Local env files — never bake these into an image
**/.env
**/.env.*

# Logs
**/npm-debug.log*
**/yarn-error.log
**/yarn-debug.log

# Docs, and local docker state (config/dev/volumes holds bind-mounted node_modules)
**/*.md
config/
